{"suttaId":"tha-ap181","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6970,6988],"vripara":"39"},"segments":{"tha-ap181:0.3":"Tikicchakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap181:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā,","tha-ap181:1.2":"vejjo āsiṃ susikkhito;","tha-ap181:1.3":"Āturānaṃ sadukkhānaṃ,","tha-ap181:1.4":"mahājanasukhāvaho.","tha-ap181:2.1":"“Byādhitaṃ samaṇaṃ disvā,","tha-ap181:2.2":"sīlavantaṃ mahājutiṃ;","tha-ap181:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano,","tha-ap181:2.4":"bhesajjamadadiṃ tadā.","tha-ap181:3.1":"“Arogo āsi teneva,","tha-ap181:3.2":"samaṇo saṃvutindriyo;","tha-ap181:3.3":"Asoko nāma nāmena,","tha-ap181:3.4":"upaṭṭhāko vipassino.","tha-ap181:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe,","tha-ap181:4.2":"yaṃ osadhamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap181:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap181:4.4":"bhesajjassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap181:5.1":"“Ito ca aṭṭhame kappe,","tha-ap181:5.2":"sabbosadhasanāmako;","tha-ap181:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno,","tha-ap181:5.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap181:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap181:6.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap181:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tikicchako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap181:8.1":"Tikicchakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3157,"to":3157,"paras":[{"para":3157,"vripara":"39","refs":["tha-ap181:1"],"lines":["So imasmiṃ buddhuppāde sāvatthiyaṃ gahapatikule nibbatto vuddhimanvāya sabbasippesu nipphattiṃ patto arogo sukhito vibhavasampanno ratanattaye pasanno satthu dhammadesanaṃ sutvā paṭiladdhasaddho gharāvāsaṃ pahāya pabbajitvā nacirasseva arahā hutvā pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>nagare bandhumatiyā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap181:1"],["tha-ap181:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap181:1.1","nagare bandhumatiyā",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
